error[E5006]: a borrow of a state's value outlives the state's flag
  --> main.prism:11:18
   11 |         first = &s.value[0]
      |                  ^^^^^^^ the value of a state is borrowed here, holding its flag
  --> main.prism:11:9
   11 |         first = &s.value[0]
      |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the state's flag ends here
  --> main.prism:14:13
   14 |     println(first)
      |             ^^^^^ borrow later used here
   = note: outside composable contexts, a borrow of a state's value holds the state's flag until its statement ends, or until the end of the block of the 'val' it initializes
   = help: borrow the value where it is used, or bind the borrow with 'val' in the block that uses it
